'''''Opportunity Makes the Thief (IV)''''' is an Event [[Adventure Mission]] from the [[Everwinter City Museum Ledger of Curiosities]] event.

==Steps==
# Speak with Pela in the museum
# Head to the Hotel Corridor of the Goethe Hotel
# Confront Mr. Cold Feet through the door
# Return to the museum and speak with Eris, the lobby secretary

