===Speak with Pela in the museum{{subst:void|<!--201190501-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=adventure|location=History and Culture Museum|You finished one phase of the museum's operations.<br />You seem to see Pela again in the exhibit hall. Perhaps there are some results from Norbert's interrogation? Go speak with her.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Pela)
:'''Pela:''' (Trailblazer), nice to see you. You're looking in good spirits.
:'''Pela:''' The museum is packed these days &mdash; I've never seen it so full of visitors. You run a tight ship here.
:'''Pela:''' Still, it'd be nice if those kids would stop littering... It's barely lunchtime and I've already picked up three half-eaten packs of snow-white popping candy.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Is there something you wanted to talk about, Pela?
::'''Pela:''' Ah, don't worry, nothing was stolen this time.
::'''Pela:''' You remember that Norbert guy we captured? The Silvermane Guards have acquired new intel from him &mdash; I thought you might find it interesting.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Kids these days...
::'''Pela:''' I know, right? I'll teach them a lesson myself if I catch them in the act, that's for sure.
::'''Pela:''' By the way, you remember that Norbert guy we captured? The Silvermane Guards have acquired new intel from him &mdash; I thought you might find it interesting.
:'''Pela:''' I always wondered &mdash; how did he, a rich kid with virtually no real life experience, suddenly think of becoming a smuggler?
:'''Pela:''' There's no way someone like him could've come up with the idea of disassembling a sculpture and hiding the pieces inside robots.
:'''Pela:''' The result is just as I expected... After less than half a day of interrogation, he confessed everything.
:'''Pela:''' He admitted that a mysterious figure named {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|Mr. Cold Feet}} persuaded him to target the museum exhibits.
:'''Pela:''' Mr. Cold Feet fooled Norbert into believing that many of the museum's artifacts were forcibly seized from private collectors by the Silvermane Guards. He told him that true justice would be returning the artifacts to the people...
:'''Pela:''' Norbert probably didn't believe any of that nonsense &mdash; I think he just wanted to prove himself and add more to his fortune.
:'''Pela:''' Mr. Cold Feet not only introduced him to buyers, but also gave him advice, and only charged him a 30% consultant's fee... In the opinion of our young Mr. Norbert, the deal was too good to refuse.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Did you find this Mr. Cold Feet?
::'''Pela:''' ...Ahem. That's what I wanted to discuss with you, (Trailblazer).
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Sounds lucrative. Why didn't he recruit me...
::'''Pela:''' ...Ahem. I'll pretend I didn't hear that.
::'''Pela:''' So, (Trailblazer), I came to discuss with you about this Mr. Cold Feet.
:'''Pela:''' Norbert said Mr. Cold Feet operates with extreme discretion and knows the Silvermane Guards' every move like the back of his hand. If he catches wind about the slightest rumor in the city, he'll disappear without a trace.
:'''Pela:''' If what Mr. Norbert said is true, then our safest option is to send a civilian to try to reach out to Mr. Cold Feet and lure him out of his lair.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You want me to go and meet him?
:'''Pela:''' You guessed it! Everyone agrees that there is no better candidate than you.
:'''Pela:''' Norbert said he usually communicates with Mr. Cold Feet {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|through the door of a room in the Goethe Hotel}}. The usual agreed meeting time is... right now.
:'''Pela:''' (Trailblazer), take this as a final request from the Silvermane Guards &mdash; can you go to the Goethe Hotel to meet with this Mr. Cold Feet?
{{Dialogue End}}

===Head to the Hotel Corridor of the Goethe Hotel{{subst:void|<!--201190502-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=adventure|location=Hotel Corridor|update|The truth is that Norbert was spurred on by a mysterious person with the code name "Mr. Cold Feet." The true mastermind behind the artifact thefts is still free.<br />Pela had already pried out of Norbert his rendezvous point with Mr. Cold Feet, which is none other than the Goethe Hotel.<br />Head to the Goethe Hotel and expose the hidden mastermind.}}
