===Confront Mr. Cold Feet through the door{{subst:void|<!--201190503-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=adventure|location=Hotel Corridor|update|The truth is Norbert was spurred on by a mysterious person with the code name "Mr. Cold Feet." The true mastermind behind the artifact thefts is still free.<br />You found the room where Mr. Cold Feet is hiding, and only a door stands between you and them.<br />Remember the secret signal Pela told you and get ready to knock on the door.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

:'''Sampo:''' ...
:'''(Trailblazer):''' ...
:'''Sampo:''' Oh... I mean &mdash; oh! If it isn't my valued client, (Trailblazer)!
:'''Sampo:''' Wh&mdash;What a pleasant surprise to see you again. Isn't it amazing how fate brings people together? Our bridge of friendship could extend all the way to Everwinter Hill!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I guessed it was you from the beginning!
::'''Sampo:''' "...Guessed?" So, you don't have any evidence...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It's amazing no one suspected you...
:'''Sampo:''' ...Eh-he. Well, I mean... how could you! Your old buddy Sampo is a model citizen, these days. Y'know the guards on sentry duty in the restricted zone? I deliver their breakfast every day, hehe...
:'''Sampo:''' Ahem... So, kinda cold out, huh, (Trailblazer)? Man, this is getting uncomfortable...
:'''Sampo:''' Okay, okay, I have a proposal &mdash; I'm sure you'll find this very reasonable. Yeah, I made a few small fortunes in the artifact business lately... and I can give you a third of my earnings. How about that, huh?
:'''Sampo:''' In exchange, I only ask that you please don't tell the Silvermane Guards about me... Just tell them you missed the culprit. You're a big hero &mdash; they won't give you a hard time about it, right?
:'''Sampo:''' How's that sound? One-third is a lot of money &mdash; think about it! I would never dare to rip off a valued client such as yourself!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} (Reject) You think I can be bought?
::'''Sampo:''' I... I mean... H&mdash;How can you be so unaccommodating? That is not like you, (Trailblazer)!
::{{tx}}
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} (Accept) Okay, it's a deal.
::'''Sampo:''' Hehe, I knew you were a reasonable person.
::{{tx}}
----
<pre>{
	"$type": "RPG.GameCore.PlayMessage",
	"MessageSectionID": 1114600,
	"ShowNotice": false
}</pre>
:...
:Sampo has vanished. No sound of hurried footsteps, no sound of a window or door opening...
:'''(Trailblazer):''' (Ugh, I let him get away...)
:'''(Trailblazer):''' (Too late now... I'll have to wait for Pela to get here.)
:{{Black Screen|You wait for a while in the empty room...}}
:'''Pela:''' (Trailblazer), I'm here! Where is the suspect?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} He escaped from under my nose.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} He... vanished into thin air.
:'''Pela:''' I see... So he's just as cunning and crafty as ever...
:'''Pela:''' He fooled the Silvermane Guards into thinking he'd changed... but we won't be falling for that act again any time soon!
:'''Pela:''' This operation ends here, (Trailblazer) &mdash; you've helped us enough already. Leave the rest to the Silvermane Guards.
:'''Pela:''' Here, these rewards are for you. I hope they come in handy on the journey ahead.
:'''Pela:''' Oh, by the way, if you still want to help run the History and Culture Museum, Miss Eris and I are always happy to work with you.
:'''Pela:''' Ah, speaking of which, Miss Eris was just looking for you &mdash; why don't you go to the museum and talk to her?
----
