:{{Black Screen|You wait for a while in the empty room...}}
:'''Pela:''' (Trailblazer), I'm here. Sorry to keep you waiting.
:'''Pela:''' Hmm... did you touch anything? This room has signs of activity.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} There was no-one here when I arrived.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Nope, nothing to do with me.
:'''Pela:''' I see... Mr. Cold Feet is a cunning one indeed...
:'''Pela:''' He knows how to keep his identity hidden, and his sources are fast and reliable... I guess he found out about Mr. Norbert's arrest and made a run for it.
:'''Pela:''' ...Still, Belobog is only so big. Unless he's brave enough to hide out in the Snow Plains, we'll catch him sooner or later.
:'''Pela:''' Thank you for all your hard work, (Trailblazer) &mdash; you've helped us enough already. Leave the rest to the Silvermane Guards.
:'''Pela:''' Oh, by the way, if you still want to help run the History and Culture Museum, Miss Eris and I are always happy to work with you.
:'''Pela:''' Ah, speaking of which, Miss Eris was just looking for you &mdash; why don't you go to the museum and talk to her?
